sequenceDiagram
    participant Ctrl as Agent Controller
    participant Mgr as AgentEgressService
    participant Docker as DockerService
    participant Guard as Egress guard<br/>(agenstra-egress-agentId)
    participant Agent as Agent container
    participant Coll as AgentEgressEventsCollectorService
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Ctrl,DB: Egress guard - provisioning and event collection

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Ctrl,Guard: Step 1 - Provision guard before the agent exists (fail closed)
        Ctrl->>Mgr: create agent + effective egress policy (layered: global, workspace, environment)
        Mgr->>Docker: create + start guard (CAP_NET_ADMIN, memory limit)
        Guard->>Guard: install lockdown netfilter rules (no policy = no egress)
        Mgr->>Guard: waitForGuardReady (squid + dnsmasq running, 30s timeout)
        Mgr->>Guard: agenstra-egress prepare
        Mgr->>Guard: upload bundle to staged/ (squid.conf, dnsmasq.conf, rules.v4/v6, allow/deny lists)
        Mgr->>Guard: agenstra-egress apply
        Guard->>Guard: validate (squid -k parse, dnsmasq --test, iptables-restore --test)
        alt Bundle valid
            Guard->>Guard: activate bundle, SIGHUP supervisor, reload squid + dnsmasq
            Guard-->>Mgr: applied revision
        else Bundle invalid
            Guard-->>Mgr: error (last known good bundle stays active)
            Mgr->>Docker: remove guard
            Mgr-->>Ctrl: provisioning fails (egressStatus failed)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Mgr,Agent: Step 2 - Agent joins the guard network namespace
        Mgr->>Docker: create agent (NetworkMode container:guard, HTTP_PROXY / HTTPS_PROXY = 127.0.0.1:3128)
        Docker->>Agent: start
        Agent->>Guard: DNS -> dnsmasq 5353, TCP 80 -> squid 3129, TCP 443 -> squid 3130 (peek / splice / terminate)
        Note over Guard: QUIC, DNS over TLS and undeclared protocols are rejected
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 232)
        Note over Ctrl,Guard: Step 3 - Policy change (config sync)
        Ctrl->>Mgr: effective policy update
        Mgr->>Mgr: compute revision (skip when guard already applied it)
        Mgr->>Guard: prepare, upload, apply
        Mgr->>Agent: recreate once only when it still runs on the legacy network
    end

    rect rgb(245, 235, 255)
        Note over Coll,DB: Step 4 - Event collection (every AGENT_EGRESS_EVENTS_POLL_INTERVAL_MS)
        loop Every poll interval
            Coll->>Guard: read logs (AGENSTRA_EGRESS web lines, AGENSTRA_GUARD events)
            Coll->>Guard: agenstra-egress counters (netfilter counted categories)
            Guard-->>Coll: log lines + counters
            Coll->>Coll: aggregate decisions (allowed, blocked, observed, error)
            Coll->>DB: INSERT agent egress events (monotonic seq)
            Coll->>DB: DELETE events older than AGENT_EGRESS_EVENTS_RETENTION_HOURS
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Ctrl,DB: Step 5 - Controller ingestion
        Ctrl->>Mgr: GET /api/egress/events?afterSeq=&limit=
        Mgr-->>Ctrl: events, nextSeq, hasMore
    end
